      "zh": "（真令人懷念呢）"
    },
    {
      "ja": "私　声が震えていた",
      "romaji": "Watashi Koe ga Furuete Ita",
      "en": "My voice was trembling",
      "zh": "我的聲音在顫抖"
    },
    {
      "ja": "(ほんの少し)",
      "romaji": "(Honno Sukoshi)",
      "en": "(Just a little)",
      "zh": "（只有一點點）"
    },
    {
      "ja": "あの日から続く未来は",
      "romaji": "Ano Hi kara Tsuzuku Mirai ha",
      "en": "The future continuing from that day",
      "zh": "從那天延續的未來"
    },
    {
